OL,3,GNEWSAPC killer died in jail from
OL,4,Anatural causes - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man jailed for the murder of a police
OL,7,Fofficer during an armed robbery died in
OL,8,Fprison from natural causes, a coroner
OL,9,Fhas concluded.
OL,11,FPiran Ditta Khan died at HMP Wakefield
OL,12,Fon 21 February last year, aged 76, less
OL,13,Fthan a year after being convicted of
OL,14,Fkilling PC Sharon Beshenivsky.
OL,16,FWakefield Coroner's Court heard Khan
OL,17,Fhad died from complications associated
OL,18,Fwith lung cancer, with no evidence he
OL,19,Fhad been assaulted or suffered any
OL,20,Ftrauma.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
