OL,3,GNEWSAPC killer died in jail from
OL,4,Anatural causes - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhan was the mastermind of the robbery
OL,7,Fat a Bradford travel agents in 2005
OL,8,Fthat ended in PC Beshenivsky being shot
OL,9,Fdead. At the time of his death he was
OL,10,Fserving a life sentence, with a minimum
OL,11,Fterm of 40 years, having spent 15 years
OL,12,Fon the run.
